<!-- 打印预览弹层：按当前模板渲染标签实打效果（二维码+字段+纸张比例），确认后发蓝牙 -->
<view class="lp-mask" wx:if="{{show}}" catchtap="onCancel" catchtouchmove="noop">
  <view class="lp-panel" catchtap="noop">
    <view class="lp-title">打印预览</view>
    <view class="lp-hint">{{styleLabel}} · 预览与实打同一排版坐标</view>
    <view class="lp-conn {{connOk ? 'lp-conn-ok' : 'lp-conn-bad'}}">
      {{connOk ? '已连接：' + connName : '未连接打印机（确认后将引导连接）'}}
    </view>

    <view class="lp-stage">
      <view wx:if="{{canPrev}}" class="lp-nav lp-nav-l" catchtap="onPrev">‹</view>
      <canvas type="2d" id="lp-canvas" class="lp-canvas" style="width: {{canvasCssW}}px; height: {{canvasCssH}}px;"></canvas>
      <view wx:if="{{canNext}}" class="lp-nav lp-nav-r" catchtap="onNext">›</view>
    </view>
    <view class="lp-index" wx:if="{{count > 1}}">{{index + 1}} / {{count}}</view>
    <view class="lp-ticket">床次 {{curTicket.bed_no || '—'}} · 第 {{curTicket.bundle_no || '—'}} 扎 · {{curTicket.color || '—'}} {{curTicket.size || '—'}} · {{curTicket.qty}} 件</view>

    <view class="lp-skip" wx:if="{{count > 1}}">
      <checkbox-group bindchange="onSkipChange">
        <label class="lp-skip-label">
          <checkbox value="1" checked="{{skipNext}}" color="#FF7A00" class="lp-skip-box" />
          <text>以后批量打印不再预览</text>
        </label>
      </checkbox-group>
      <view class="lp-skip-hint">可在「打印管理」页恢复预览确认</view>
    </view>

    <view class="lp-btns">
      <button class="lp-btn lp-cancel" catchtap="onCancel">取消</button>
      <button class="lp-btn lp-ok" catchtap="onConfirm">确认打印{{count > 1 ? '（共 ' + count + ' 张）' : ''}}</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
